# A status read checks only tenancy, not Read authority over the operation's
# tree.
MODULE: ReadNeedsReadStatusUnchecked
TARGET: ReadNeedsRead
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a status read skips the read capability
PERTURBS: Act

--- FIND
                 /\ seen' = seen \cup {<<c, p[1], p[2]>> : p \in {q \in ops : q[1] = c /\ Allowed(c, q[2], "Read")}}
--- REPLACE
                 /\ seen' = seen \cup {<<c, p[1], p[2]>> : p \in {q \in ops : q[1] = c /\ TenancyAllows(c, q[2])}}
--- END
